  "description": "Nationwide fallback sector for administrative complaints that do not belong to a more specific regulated sector.",
  "purpose": [
    "Route general administrative injustice primarily to the Public Complaints Commission",
    "Include SERVICOM only for public-service delivery failures",
    "Include FCCPC only for relevant consumer-service complaints",
    "Include NHRC only where the facts disclose a human-rights issue",
    "Require official dynamic resolution for state PCC offices and internal institutional complaint units",
    "Prevent guessed contacts and unrelated copying"
